# Input

```yaml
key: a plain value that is long enough to exceed the default line width of eighty
  
```


# Formatted

```yaml
key: a plain value that is long enough to exceed the default line width of eighty

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
    1: key: a plain value that is long enough to exceed the default line width of eighty
```
